  "Description": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "The \"Dustmen\" are the caretakers of the Mortuary, a huge morgue filled with bodies. The faction seems to be a pretty somber bunch, rarely showing expression or interest in anything. They seem intent only upon taking care of all the dead bodies that come into the Mortuary, cataloguing them, preparing them, then burying them... somewhere.",
      "8": "El estricto secretario de la universidad Myrdon Salasker, implacable perseguidor de la correspondencia perdida y  los alumnos que hacen ruido por los pasillos. Es normal su severidad, pues añora los tiempos en los que su orden monástica vivía en paz contemplativa "
    }
  },
